# Terraform test infrastructure (terraform/) — local state, generated SSH keys,
# and the provider binary cache never get tracked. The .tf configs themselves,
# and .terraform.lock.hcl (pins provider versions — meant to be committed), ARE.
terraform/**/.terraform/
terraform/**/terraform.tfstate
terraform/**/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform/**/*.tfvars
terraform/**/crash.log
terraform/**/override.tf
terraform/**/override.tf.json
terraform/**/*.pem
terraform/**/*_rsa
terraform/**/*_rsa.pub
